WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.616
We are going to meet new people. Here is what we can do.

2
00:00:05.616 --> 00:00:11.232
We can say hello. Just hello is a good start.

3
00:00:11.232 --> 00:00:15.312
We can say our name: my name is ... .

4
00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:22.008
The other person might ask a question. One question at a time is fine.

5
00:00:22.008 --> 00:00:28.440
Short answers are okay. We do not have to talk for a long time.

6
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:34.080
If we need a pause, we can say: give me a moment.

7
00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:41.688
Leaving after a short time is allowed. We can say: nice to meet you, bye.

8
00:00:41.688 --> 00:00:47.232
Meeting people gets easier each time, at our own pace.

9
00:00:47.232 --> 00:00:55.440
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

